WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.003 --> 00:00:03.590
- It's not that difficult
to be a young CEO.

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:06.070
Some people mistake me as an adult.

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:08.330
People are generally supportive
about what I'm doing,

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:11.703
and I get a lot of pretty
interesting advice from people.

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:17.645
- [Narrator] This Great Big
Story was made possible by LEGO.

00:00:17.645 --> 00:00:18.863
Play her way.

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:28.890
- I'm Hillary Yip, I'm 14
and I live in Hong Kong.

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:31.100
I'm the founder and CEO of MinorMynas.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:34.890
Minor Mynas started as a
foreign language learning app,

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:37.100
where we connect kids
from all over the world.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:39.270
First to learn in a
peer-to-peer environment

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:41.580
and to make friends from across boarders.

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:43.200
Right now we've got users from

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.910
150 countries and counting.

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:47.477
I think we kids are
neglected on the market

00:00:47.477 --> 00:00:51.840
before other video games
or educational products.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:53.770
MinorMynas wants to be the middle ground,

00:00:53.770 --> 00:00:56.400
where we're able to have
fun by getting to connect

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:59.593
with new friends, while being
able to learn something new.

00:01:02.005 --> 00:01:05.970
When I was 10 years old
my Chinese was appalling,

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:08.325
and my mom finally had it
and sent my brother and I to

00:01:08.325 --> 00:01:10.500
a Chinese summer camp.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.700
It went very well because we had no choice

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:14.340
but to speak in Mandarin.

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.010
And a couple months later when I saw

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:17.821
entrepreneurship competition for kids,

00:01:17.821 --> 00:01:20.720
I wondered if I could bring
the experience online,

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:22.740
so that all us kids can learn languages

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.193
in a more effective manner.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:27.730
After the competition,
someone approached me

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:29.700
and said that he'd love to be my mentor

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:31.464
if I wanted to continue my idea.

00:01:31.464 --> 00:01:33.043
So I jumped at the chance.

00:01:35.930 --> 00:01:38.225
What is MinorMynas able to do?

00:01:38.225 --> 00:01:40.480
First of all, we are able to provide

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:42.650
a safe environment for kids.

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:44.890
The best thing about
being a CEO is the freedom

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:45.890
and the flexibility.

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:48.720
What I do on a day-to-day basis

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:51.970
is generally pitching,
developing investor decks,

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:54.449
talking to investors,
talking to customers,

00:01:54.449 --> 00:01:57.357
writing up our vision for the future

00:01:57.357 --> 00:02:00.440
and executing upon marketing grounds.

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:02.930
Outside of school hours, I tend to just

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:05.280
prioritize my tasks with MinorMynas.

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:07.330
So, after I get every thing done,

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:09.110
I get to read, I get to debate,

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:12.173
and when my friends are in town
I get to hangout with them.

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:15.994
My family has been very very supportive.

00:02:15.994 --> 00:02:18.110
(mumbles) my mom learning with me

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:20.640
throughout the whole
journey of MinorMynas.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:23.367
Because none of us have
worked on a startup before.

00:02:25.129 --> 00:02:28.710
There will always be people
who tell you that you can't.

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:32.490
Whether it's because of your
age, gender, where your from.

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:35.210
But what we can do is
to continue working on

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:36.400
what we're doing.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:38.880
That's the only way we
can prove them wrong.

